---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About — Venkata Sai Gummadelli"
    description="About Venkata Sai Gummadelli — what I am learning, building, and exploring."
>

    <section class="about-page">

        <div class="section-label">
            <span>ABOUT</span>
            <span>VSG</span>
        </div>

        <div class="about-intro">

            <h1>
                Learning deeply.<br />
                Building seriously.<br />
                <em>Thinking long-term.</em>
            </h1>

            <p class="about-lead">
                I am interested in understanding how things work,
                building with what I learn, and writing about ideas
                that are worth exploring properly.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-grid">

            <div class="about-label">
                <span>01</span>
                <span>WHAT I DO</span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-content">

                <p>
                    My current focus is Artificial Intelligence and
                    the systems being built around it.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I spend a lot of time going beyond the surface —
                    understanding the foundations, experimenting with
                    systems, and connecting ideas across different areas
                    of technology.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Writing is part of that process. It forces me to
                    understand something well enough to explain it clearly.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="about-grid">

            <div class="about-label">
                <span>02</span>
                <span>CURRENTLY EXPLORING</span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-content">

                <ul class="about-list">
                    <li>Artificial Intelligence</li>
                    <li>Large Language Models</li>
                    <li>Agentic AI</li>
                    <li>AI Systems & Infrastructure</li>
                    <li>Research & Emerging Technologies</li>
                </ul>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="about-grid">

            <div class="about-label">
                <span>03</span>
                <span>BEYOND TECHNOLOGY</span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-content">

                <p>
                    Technology is only one part of the journey.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Over time, I want to explore business, products,
                    entrepreneurship, and the process of turning ideas
                    into things that create real value.
                </p>

                <p>
                    This website is meant to grow with that journey.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="about-cta">

            <p>
                If you find something interesting here, <a href="/writing">read the writing →</a>
            </p>

        </div>

    </section>

</BaseLayout>